  "synopsis": "A dating sim enthusiast wakes up in the body of Reine Waynewright: an adorable otome heroine in a fantasy game! Reine discovers that in this world, she's a lowly F-rank student at the magical Heartfelt Academy, bullied by her classmates and snubbed by her love interests for her lack of talent. Determined to avoid a Bad Ending, Reine resolves to study hard, practice her magic, and pass the exams to increase her rank!\n\nIf she grinds hard enough, she may be able to change her fate: make new friends, improve herself, and maybe even fall in love along the way!\n\n(Source: Tokyopop)",
